# Auto detect text files, store them with LF and check them out with LF on every platform,
# so hashed data (dataset files, recorded runs) keeps the same bytes in every clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Recorded event logs are hashed byte for byte: never convert them.
*.jsonl -text
# Binary formats, stated explicitly rather than left to detection.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.pptx binary
# Preserve the captured hardware receipt's whitespace byte for byte.
runs/decision20-pro6000-20261003/nvidia-smi.txt -whitespace
